  "citation": "Jones P D; Raper S C B; Cherry B S G; Goodess C M; Wigley T M L; Santer B; Kelly P M; Bradley R S; Diaz H F (2018): An Updated Global Grid Point Surface Air Temperature Anomaly Data Set: 1851-1990 (revised 1991) (NDP-020). Carbon Dioxide Information Analysis Center (CDIAC), Oak Ridge National Laboratory (ORNL), Oak Ridge, TN (United States). Dataset. doi:10.3334/CDIAC/CLI.NDP020",
